	ckets\nResale Tickets \nNurse John LIVE at Oxnard Levity Live\nGet ready f
	or a hilarious night of stand-up comedy as Nurse John brings his acclaimed
	 “Short Staffed” tour to Oxnard Levity Live on July 16\, 2026. Known for h
	is sharp wit and relatable humor\, Nurse John delivers a comedy experience
	 you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 16\, 2026\
	nTime: 7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Oxnard Levity Live\nAddress: 591 Collection Blv
	d\, Oxnard\, CA 93036\nAge Requirement: 21+ Event\nMinimum Purchase: Two-i
	tem minimum per person in the showroom \nAbout Nurse John\nNurse John is a
	 rising stand-up comedian who has built a massive following with his uniqu
	e blend of observational humor and storytelling. His “Short Staffed” tour 
	has been selling out venues across the country\, bringing his signature co
	medic style to audiences everywhere. With a background that gives him plen
	ty of material\, Nurse John delivers laughs that are both sharp and deeply
	 relatable. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of stand-up comedy from one
	 of the hottest acts on tour\nSharp\, witty material drawn from real-life 
	experiences\nAn intimate club setting at Oxnard Levity Live\nFull bar and 
	dining service available throughout the show\nGeneral admission seating (f
	irst-come\, first-served)\nAn unforgettable night of laughs in Oxnard\, CA
	\n\nVenue Information\nOxnard Levity Live is one of Southern California’s 
	premier comedy clubs\, located at 591 Collection Blvd in Oxnard\, CA. The 
	intimate showroom offers excellent sightlines from every seat\, full bar s
	ervice\, and a two-item minimum purchase per guest. \nTicket Information\n
	Tickets range from $43.19 to $113.80. This is a 21+ event — valid photo ID
	 required. All sales are final. Ticket resale is strictly prohibited by th
	e venue. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate
